s Forever (Jennings Mafia Family #3)","authors":["D. Scott"],"pageCount":218,"publicationDate":"2025","status":"read","genreIds":[],"tropeIds":[],"tagIds":[],"shelfIds":[],"formats":["ebook"],"ownership":[],"primaryFormat":"ebook","personalRating":5,"certifiedSlay":true,"brainChemistry":false,"favorite":false,"goodreadsBookId":"241455271","dateAdded":"2025-11-09","source":"goodreads","createdAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.944Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.944Z"},"readingRecord":{"id":"goodreads-241455271-read-1","bookId":"goodreads-241455271","status":"completed","readingMethod":"ebook","finishedAt":"2025-11-13","rating":5,"certifiedSlay":true,"readingNumber":1,"isReread":false,"progressEntries":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.944Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.944Z"},"rawShelves":["5-star-reads","soft-girl-comfort"],"readCount":1,"wasTbbBuddyRead":false,"review":null},{"book":{"id":"goodreads-239051133","title":"Trouble Forever (Jennings Mafia Family #1)","authors":["D. Scott"],"pageCount":193,"publicationDate":"2025","status":"read","genreIds":[],"tropeIds":[],"tagIds":[],"shelfIds":[],"formats":["ebook"],"ownership":[],"primaryFormat":"ebook","personalRating":5,"certifiedSlay":true,"brainChemistry":false,"favorite":false,"goodreadsBookId":"239051133","dateAdded":"2025-11-09","source":"goodreads","createdAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.944Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.944Z"},"readingRecord":{"id":"goodreads-239051133-read-1","bookId":"goodreads-239051133","status":"completed","readingMethod":"ebook","finishedAt":"2025-11-11","rating":5,"certifiedSlay":true,"readingNumber":1,"isReread":false,"progressEntries":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.944Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.944Z"},"rawShelves":["5-star-reads","soft-girl-comfort"],"readCount":1,"wasTbbBuddyRead":false,"review":{"id":"goodreads-review-239051133","bookId":"goodreads-239051133","readingRecordId":"goodreads-239051133-read-1","rating":5,"body":"Mr. Trouble himself? Yeah… he is everything. I’m not even big on Mafia romances, but this one had me hooked from page one. When I say I ate this book up?! Whew. In my book world, Capone Delgato has always been HIM — untouchable, unrivaled. I truly never thought another character would come close… but after reading this? Yeah, that throne is officially being shared.<br/><br/>Babyyy, Trouble lives up to that name! And the fact that it's not just one but three of them? The Delgato brothers understood the assignment and then some.<br/><br/>Quick, addictive, and absolutely a must-read. If you're looking for a book that grabs you and does not let go, this is the one.","containsSpoilers":false,"createdAt":"2025-11-11T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-11T00:00:00.000Z"}},{"book":{"id":"goodreads-240380822","title":"Still Forever (Jennings Mafia Family #2)","authors":["D. Scott"],"publicationDate":"2025","status":"read","genreIds":[],"tropeIds":[],"tagIds":[],"shelfIds":[],"formats":["ebook"],"ownership":[],"primaryFormat":"ebook","personalRating":5,"certifiedSlay":true,"brainChemistry":false,"favorite":false,"goodreadsBookId":"240380822","dateAdded":"2025-11-09","source":"goodreads","createdAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.944Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.944Z"},"readingRecord":{"id":"goodreads-240380822-read-1","bookId":"goodreads-240380822","status":"completed","readingMethod":"ebook","finishedAt":"2025-11-13","rating":5,"certifiedSlay":true,"readingNumber":1,"isReread":false,"progressEntries":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.944Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.944Z"},"rawShelves":["5-star-reads","soft-girl-comfort"],"readCount":1,"wasTbbBuddyRead":false,"review":{"id":"goodreads-review-240380822","bookId":"goodreads-240380822","readingRecordId":"goodreads-240380822-read-1","rating":5,"body":"After devouring the first book, I slid straight into this one and tore through it just the same. I love the way the Jennings brothers move, the shared qualities, the individual distinctions, the unity. Their bond is the kind of closeness I wish more melanated families had; they stayed solid, never once turning on each other or letting chaos break their circle.<br/><br/>Now Mr. Jaxon? He was not about to play with KD! The way he stood on business for him, even with his life possibly on the line, had me locked in. And I have to give an honorable mention to Remy — the way she stood by Jaxon, supported him, and stayed honest and intentional. Top tier.<br/><br/>It’s been a long time since I’ve given two back-to-back 5-star ratings in a series. Honestly, it’s only happened one other time. But this series? Yeah… It’s a solid 5 stars straight through. And now I’m running right into Judah’s story with no breaks.","containsSpoilers":false,"createdAt":"2025-11-13T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-13T00:00:00.000Z"}},{"book":{"id":"goodreads-243813868","title":"The Fractured Thread (Color Edition): Where shadows are cursed and bloodlines hold the key","authors":["Nyxara Wolfwyn"],"pageCount":354,"publicationDate":"2025","publisher":"Independently published","status":"tbr","genreIds":[],"tropeIds":[],"tagIds":[],"shelfIds":[],"formats":["physical"],"ownership":[],"primaryFormat":"physical","certifiedSlay":false,"brainChemistry":false,"favorite":false,"goodreadsBookId":"243813868","dateAdded":"2025-11-13","source":"goodreads","createdAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.944Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.944Z"},"readingRecord":null,"rawShelves":["to-read"],"readCount":0,"wasTbbBuddyRead":false,"review":null},{"book":{"id":"goodreads-85150686","title":"Murder on the Christmas Express","authors":["Alexandra Benedict"],"isbn10":"1728284414","isbn13":"9781728284422","pageCount":272,"publicationDate":"2022","publisher":"Poisoned Pen Press","status":"tbr","genreIds":[],"tropeIds":[],"tagIds":[],"shelfIds":[],"formats":["ebook"],"ownership":[],"primaryFormat":"ebook","certifiedSlay":false,"brainChemistry":false,"favorite":false,"goodreadsBookId":"85150686","dateAdded":"2025-11-13","source":"goodreads","create