d in her, and the unbreakable bond she shared with her brother. Through humor and vulnerability, Goldberg reflects on love, loss, and the profound impact of family, making this memoir both deeply personal and universally relatable.<br/><br/>This book is not just about grief; it’s about the lasting presence of those we love, even after they’re gone. Goldberg’s storytelling feels like a conversation with a close friend—funny, moving, and filled with wisdom. Whether you’ve experienced similar loss or simply appreciate a beautifully told memoir, Bits and Pieces is a touching and unforgettable read. I highly suggest listening to the audiobook format, told by Whoopi herself.","containsSpoilers":false,"createdAt":"2025-03-04T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2025-03-04T00:00:00.000Z"}},{"book":{"id":"goodreads-49515916","title":"Shots Not Taken (Nymphs & Trojans #1)","authors":["Nicole Falls"],"pageCount":278,"publicationDate":"2019","status":"tbr","genreIds":[],"tropeIds":[],"tagIds":[],"shelfIds":[],"formats":["ebook"],"ownership":[],"primaryFormat":"ebook","certifiedSlay":false,"brainChemistry":false,"favorite":false,"goodreadsBookId":"49515916","dateAdded":"2025-03-03","source":"goodreads","createdAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.947Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.947Z"},"readingRecord":null,"rawShelves":["to-read"],"readCount":0,"wasTbbBuddyRead":false,"review":null},{"book":{"id":"goodreads-218372269","title":"Love in Focus","authors":["Lyla Lee"],"isbn10":"1538767554","isbn13":"9781538767559","pageCount":320,"publicationDate":"2025","publisher":"Forever","status":"tbr","genreIds":[],"tropeIds":[],"tagIds":[],"shelfIds":[],"formats":["physical"],"ownership":[],"primaryFormat":"physical","certifiedSlay":false,"brainChemistry":false,"favorite":false,"goodreadsBookId":"218372269","dateAdded":"2025-03-03","source":"goodreads","createdAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.947Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.947Z","coverUrl":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9781538767559-L.jpg"},"readin