,"status":"completed","readingMethod":"ebook","finishedAt":"2025-02-24","rating":3,"certifiedSlay":false,"readingNumber":1,"isReread":false,"progressEntries":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.947Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.947Z"},"rawShelves":[],"readCount":1,"wasTbbBuddyRead":false,"review":null},{"book":{"id":"goodreads-223663305","title":"The Virgin BBW Surrogate 2 : A Hood Billionaire Romance","authors":["Tiece"],"pageCount":185,"publicationDate":"2025","publisher":"TIECE PRESENTS","status":"read","genreIds":[],"tropeIds":[],"tagIds":[],"shelfIds":[],"formats":["ebook"],"ownership":[],"primaryFormat":"ebook","personalRating":5,"certifiedSlay":true,"brainChemistry":false,"favorite":false,"goodreadsBookId":"223663305","dateAdded":"2025-02-11","source":"goodreads","createdAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.947Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.947Z"},"readingRecord":{"id":"goodreads-223663305-read-1","bookId":"goodreads-223663305","status":"completed","readingMethod":"ebook","finishedAt":"2025-02-16","rating":5,"certifiedSlay":true,"readingNumber":1,"isReread":false,"progressEntries":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.947Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.947Z"},"rawShelves":["5-star-reads"],"readCount":1,"wasTbbBuddyRead":false,"review":{"id":"goodreads-review-223663305","bookId":"goodreads-223663305","readingRecordId":"goodreads-223663305-read-1","rating":5,"body":"⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ A Gripping Sequel Full of Drama, Love, and Unexpected Twists!<br/><br/>Tiece masterfully continues the saga in The Virgin BBW Surrogate 2, delivering a sequel that is even more intense and emotionally charged than the first. Emmy’s journey is both heart-wrenching and empowering—watching her navigate the unexpected twists of her surrogacy journey while dealing with deep personal struggles made her a character I truly rooted for. She’s strong, yet vulnerable, and her growth in this book is beautifully written.<br/><br/>Tangela, on the other hand, is the kind of character that keeps you flipping pages, whether you love her or love to hate her. Her presence adds just the right amount of tension and drama, making every interaction with Emmy explosive. Orlan’s role in all of this is complex—his decisions and emotions are layered, making him a character you can’t easily pin down. His chemistry with Emmy is undeniable, and the push-and-pull between them had me on edge.<br/><br/>This book had me hooked from start to finish. Tiece knows how to create characters that feel real, with emotions that jump off the page. If you love a story packed with drama, passion, and characters you can’t stop thinking about, The Virgin BBW Surrogate 2 is a must-read! I’m literally about to start the third one!","containsSpoilers":false,"createdAt":"2025-02-16T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2025-02-16T00:00:00.000Z"}},{"book":{"id":"goodreads-196864520","title":"Butcher & Blackbird (The Ruinous Love Trilogy, #1)","authors":["Brynne Weaver"],"isbn13":"9798857497074","pageCount":360,"publicationDate":"2023","publisher":"Independently Published","status":"read","genreIds":[],"tropeIds":[],"tagIds":[],"shelfIds":[],"formats":["physical"],"ownership":[],"primaryFormat":"physical","personalRating":2,"certifiedSlay":false,"brainChemistry":false,"favorite":false,"goodreadsBookId":"196864520","dateAdded":"2024-05-06","source":"goodreads","createdAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.947Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.947Z","coverUrl":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9798857497074-L.jpg"},"readingRecord":{"id":"goodreads-196864520-read-1","bookId":"goodreads-196864520","status":"completed","readingMethod":"physical","finishedAt":"2025-02-16","rating":2,"certifiedSlay":false,"readingNumber":1,"isReread":false,"progressEntries":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.947Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-06T16:56:09.947Z"},"rawShelves":[],"readCount":1,"wasTbbBuddyRead":false,"review":null},{"book":{"id":"goodreads-223231554","title":"Aisle Be Yours: A Valentine's Novella","authors":["Nina High"],"isbn13":"9798